@startuml
title SEQ-12 - Personal Course and Homework
autonumber
actor Learner
boundary Web
control GotIt
control Core
participant AI
database DB as "product_gotit"

Learner -> Web: Build a course with the teacher
Web -> GotIt: POST /courses/intake\neventId + language pair
GotIt -> Core: Authenticate + practice.play
GotIt -> AI: One adaptive needs question
GotIt -> DB: Save intake + command receipt
GotIt --> Web: Question + suggestions + preferences draft
loop Relevant questions
  Learner -> Web: Text or recorded answer
  opt Voice
    Web -> GotIt: POST /courses/transcribe\ntransient WAV
    GotIt -> AI: Transcribe
    GotIt --> Web: Editable text
  end
  Web -> GotIt: POST /courses/:id/turns\nrevision + eventId
  GotIt -> AI: Adapt question and draft preferences
  GotIt -> DB: CAS document + receipt in one transaction
  GotIt --> Web: Updated saved state
end
Web --> Learner: Review preferences, reported needs and recommendations
Learner -> Web: Explicit preference approval
Web -> GotIt: POST /preferences/approve
GotIt -> DB: Save approved snapshot
Web -> GotIt: POST /plan
GotIt -> AI: Generate complete language-specific units
GotIt -> GotIt: Validate coverage, prerequisites and preserved history
GotIt -> DB: CAS new draft version + receipt
GotIt --> Web: Full plan for review
Learner -> Web: Approve exact plan version
Web -> GotIt: POST /activate\nrevision + version + eventId
GotIt -> DB: Activate version
Web -> GotIt: Start private lesson with courseId
GotIt -> DB: Resolve approved next objective + homework context
ref over Web,DB
SEQ-07 - Private lesson, summary and queued homework
end ref
Learner -> Web: Open homework
Web -> GotIt: GET /courses/homework/:id
opt Pending assignment
  Web -> GotIt: POST /homework/:id/prepare
  GotIt -> AI: Generate only from taught excerpts
  GotIt -> GotIt: Validate exact source quote
  GotIt -> DB: CAS tasks and private answer keys
end
loop One task at a time
  Learner -> Web: Answer, hint, skip or save draft
  Web -> GotIt: POST /homework/:id/actions\nrevision + eventId
  opt Open answer requires judgment
    GotIt -> AI: Evaluate stated objective; uncertainty is not failure
  end
  GotIt -> DB: Commit attempt and receipt atomically
  GotIt --> Web: Feedback, saved progress, solution only when done
  Web --> Learner: Feedback then explicit next action
end
note over Web,DB
Owner comes from Core. Stale writes fail.
Replay returns the original committed snapshot.
Raw audio is not persisted. Existing vocabulary XP/mastery is unchanged.
end note
@enduml
